  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Every brand you admire has a visual style guide. Not because they're pretentious—because it's the only way to keep 100+ product photos looking cohesive over years."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Here's how to build one for your store."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "What a Photo Style Guide Includes"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Background rules (color, style, texture)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Lighting direction and mood"
        },
        {
          "text": "Cropping and composition standards"
        },
        {
          "text": "Aspect ratio requirements"
        },
        {
          "text": "Color palette"
        },
        {
          "text": "Typography (for overlays)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Watermark/logo placement rules"
        },
        {
          "text": "Approved and forbidden aesthetics"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Document these once. Reference forever."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "The Background Rule"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Pick one primary background style. Examples:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pure white (Amazon-first brands)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Soft off-white/cream (premium boutique)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Signature brand color (bold, distinctive)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Neutral gray gradient (modern minimalist)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Every product photo across your entire catalog should use this base. edit-photo.com makes it trivial to apply consistently."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Secondary backgrounds are okay for lifestyle shots—but the main image is always the same."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "The Lighting Direction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Consistent lighting angle across all product photos is what makes catalogs feel professional."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Pick:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Light from the top-left (classic)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Light from directly above (flat, modern)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Front lighting (mannequin-style)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Then always shoot from that direction. Never mix. Even AI can't fully correct wildly different lighting angles."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "The Crop Standard"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Every product photo should share:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Same aspect ratio (1:1 or 4:5 recommended)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Same product-to-frame ratio (product fills 70-85%)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Same margin around product (10-15%)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Same vertical alignment (centered or slightly-below-center)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use a dedicated crop or layout editor for exact framing, then use edit-photo for background removal and edge review."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "The Color Palette"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Beyond backgrounds, your brand needs a defined palette for:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Any overlay text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Badges and callouts"
        },
        {
          "text": "Composite elements"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ad creative additions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "3-5 colors max. Applied consistently everywhere."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Use Rights-Safe Source Images"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Options:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "No logo on product photos (Amazon-compliant, clean)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Small logo in corner (brand recognition, 5% max)"
        },
        {
          "text": "Watermark for social media only (protection from theft)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Pick one. Document it. Enforce it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "The Forbidden List"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Explicitly state what's not allowed:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "No cluttered backgrounds"
        },
        {
          "text": "No mismatched lighting"
        },
        {
          "text": "No inconsistent cropping"
        },
        {
          "text": "No off-brand backgrounds"
        },
        {
          "text": "No unedited supplier photos"
        },
        {
          "text": "No watermarks from third parties"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Give this list to anyone helping with photos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "The Enforcement Process"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For every new product:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shoot per style guide"
        },
        {
          "text": "Edit through edit-photo.com with standard settings"
        },
        {
          "text": "QA against style guide checklist"
        },
        {
          "text": "Publish"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For old products, do the same as a catalog refresh project."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "The Team Angle"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "If you have team members, VAs, or contractors handling photos, they must follow the style guide. Share the document. Include example photos. Show approved vs rejected samples."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
